Full `oodac/main.oo` pure multi with `PURE_SKIP_CHECK=0` was **not** attempted
beyond the check budget (check alone >120s); claiming pure multi dual-green on
self-host under check is false.

`import_load_smoke.oo`: **ALL OK** (~0.62s) — multi_ok check + missing/cycle
fail-closed for check/concat/pure_build missing paths.

